{"unit_id":"Findly-qwb__dsh-model-picker#card-zh","repo":"Findly-qwb/dsh-model-picker","commit":"f5705d9460d1609bad650835cdf1a290197a3a7a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的模型选择插件。它接管输入框旁的模型选择位置，打开一个双栏面板：左侧可跨模型、供应商和能力标签搜索，并按供应商分组显示收藏与最近使用；右侧展示已解析的上下文容量、输入能力和推理档位。用户可切换当前会话模型、设为默认、查看详情并复制模型 ID。适合需要快速浏览多个模型路由的 Harness 用户；收藏和最近记录保存在本机插件目录中。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-3","client.js:700-797","client.js:908-978","client.js:1160-1305","index.js:35-57"]}
{"unit_id":"Findly-qwb__dsh-model-picker#card-en","repo":"Findly-qwb/dsh-model-picker","commit":"f5705d9460d1609bad650835cdf1a290197a3a7a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-picker replaces the Harness Web composer model menu with a searchable two-pane picker. Browse by provider, pin favorites, revisit recent choices, and inspect capacity or reasoning options. Apply a model to this session or save it as the default. Preferences stay on the local machine.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-3","client.js:700-797","client.js:908-978","client.js:1160-1305","index.js:35-57"]}
